hist:Person_125dce74 hist:hasRank "문과 병과 급제 (1580)" .
hist:Person_125dce74 hist:hasRank "평창군수" .
hist:Person_125dce74 hist:hasRank "참판 (추증, 1791)" .
hist:Person_125dce74 hist:hasAchievement "정문 건립(1666, 송준길의 상소로)" .
hist:Person_125dce74 hist:hasAchievement "온양 충효사우에 배향" .
