hist:Place_375c9ec9 rdf:type hist:Place .
hist:Place_375c9ec9 rdfs:label "연산군 묘역" .
hist:Place_375c9ec9 hist:hasSummary "묘역 건너편 방학로 맞은편에 자리한 연산군의 묘역." .
